      "Language": "ger",
      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "Based on a case report, occasionally observed, degenerative changes of the spinal meninx in a sense of meningiosis are presented that are not yet described. The patient was a thirteen-year-old dog, showing paraparesis and spinal pain. Findings of X-Ray examination, surgery and histology are described."},
